{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, long time no see! I had a big win in my game last week - finally advanced to the next level! It was a huge confidence booster and felt like I'd really achieved something."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-560d0c6e88f409b4eb7dec80", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.652481+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "560d0c6e88f409b4eb7dec80", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "560d0c6e88f409b4eb7dec80", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John, congrats on your win! Games can really boost confidence, huh? I'm challenging myself too - I'm learning this instrument, which has been quite the journey."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-58ed2a782f3f664de304ffcd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.679989+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "58ed2a782f3f664de304ffcd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "58ed2a782f3f664de304ffcd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James! I play drums too! Here's a pic of my set."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-1672dcffc5fd7b22b2483573", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.699407+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1672dcffc5fd7b22b2483573", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1672dcffc5fd7b22b2483573", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, looking good! How long have you been playing?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-a47d7120d9e88744d24b3ff1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.717066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a47d7120d9e88744d24b3ff1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a47d7120d9e88744d24b3ff1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've been playing for a month now, it's been tough but fun. How about you, how's it going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-60e00a159eb224dbc0a921df", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.731431+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60e00a159eb224dbc0a921df", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60e00a159eb224dbc0a921df", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: This is going great! I started a few days ago, so I'm still picking it up. Been at it daily and seeing improvements. It's tough but rewarding at the same time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-e93d2cdb8543bb1aca30333d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.747144+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e93d2cdb8543bb1aca30333d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e93d2cdb8543bb1aca30333d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice work! Looks like you're doing great. Anything new in general that you'd recommend?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-a6ef8c918ebda68244a15b77", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.769261+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6ef8c918ebda68244a15b77", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6ef8c918ebda68244a15b77", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks! I just got a new cutting-edge gaming system and the graphics are incredible. I've been playing all kinds of new games and it's been a great way to relax after work. Plus, I can connect with friends who share my passion for gaming."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-647fe6349ebf71253f35da75", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.787863+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "647fe6349ebf71253f35da75", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "647fe6349ebf71253f35da75", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool, James! Gaming is great for chilling out. Btw, since we last spoke, I had the chance to go to a gaming convention - it was amazing! Tried out loads of games, met developers, and even took part in a tournament - unreal! Check out this pic I took!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-ade9acb36580ebdf5e620b6f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.808412+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ade9acb36580ebdf5e620b6f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ade9acb36580ebdf5e620b6f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, that's awesome! What game was it for? Sounds like a dream!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-7af81bfca5ce84125c12f5f7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.826913+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7af81bfca5ce84125c12f5f7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7af81bfca5ce84125c12f5f7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I played my favorite CS:GO game in an intense tournament. It was awesome to see all the skilled players competing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-55c90deb92af2e5c81fd8c29", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.846660+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "55c90deb92af2e5c81fd8c29", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "55c90deb92af2e5c81fd8c29", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow, that sounds cool! Gaming is awesome with all the competition. Must have been thrilling to watch those skilled players!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-71c4f18d5c8829bb156839eb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.867000+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "71c4f18d5c8829bb156839eb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "71c4f18d5c8829bb156839eb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It was indeed amazing! Watching those skilled players really inspired me to improve my own gaming skills."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-0c845ba1b863c460910802ad", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.881456+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0c845ba1b863c460910802ad", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0c845ba1b863c460910802ad", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Nice one, John! Learning from experienced gamers can really help you level up your skills. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-6e54ff07face72a65ffe8539", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.898103+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e54ff07face72a65ffe8539", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e54ff07face72a65ffe8539", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'm always looking to up my game and hit new goals. That same commitment is true for my hobbies and other stuff. What have you been doing to stay motivated?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-37ad0162378c415198fa078b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.913017+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "37ad0162378c415198fa078b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "37ad0162378c415198fa078b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Setting small goals and tracking my progress helps me stay motivated and focused."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-0d539d69faf3f55759c6e44b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.933353+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0d539d69faf3f55759c6e44b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0d539d69faf3f55759c6e44b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice one! Setting small goals and tracking progress is a great way to stay motivated - it helps you stay on track and celebrates progress. Anything specific you're working on or upcoming challenges you're pumped about?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-615b59872dec62adcfb09cde", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.947947+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "615b59872dec62adcfb09cde", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "615b59872dec62adcfb09cde", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I'm getting into different types of games now, like RPGs and strategy games. It's really exciting!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-44cbbbbc36ab74985e02e41a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.972143+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "44cbbbbc36ab74985e02e41a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "44cbbbbc36ab74985e02e41a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool, James! That sounds exciting. Have fun exploring different genres of games!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-f3d086d4cac425bd78fb3612", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:57.993430+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f3d086d4cac425bd78fb3612", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f3d086d4cac425bd78fb3612", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I'm super hyped to explore different game genres. Let's see what's in store!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-d4fba051e3fd2091b98172d0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:58.011821+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d4fba051e3fd2091b98172d0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d4fba051e3fd2091b98172d0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Definitely! Trying new genres is always exciting. I can't wait to hear about your journey with them. Please let me know how it goes!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-f52e22f20e79d69e303e9614", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:58.030607+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f52e22f20e79d69e303e9614", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f52e22f20e79d69e303e9614", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Got it, John! I'll keep you updated on my gaming adventures with the new genres. Have a good day!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-fd5487ec3dff9cff94d3ceb8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:58.048777+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd5487ec3dff9cff94d3ceb8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd5487ec3dff9cff94d3ceb8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! Can't wait to hear about it. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-47/session_3-c6acbfb4b4b23604476c5aac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:45:58.067336+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6acbfb4b4b23604476c5aac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6acbfb4b4b23604476c5aac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
